[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17281.51, "timestamp": "04:48:01", "text": "上帝。好的。总之，呃，别在意我。为什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17283.27, "timestamp": "04:48:03", "text": "我要放烟吗？你应该扔一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17285.51, "timestamp": "04:48:05", "text": "用手榴弹代替烟雾弹。是的，我确实这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17288.15, "timestamp": "04:48:08", "text": "那。哦，是的。是的，我之前就做过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17290.15, "timestamp": "04:48:10", "text": "当我中枪时，我忘了……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17291.31, "timestamp": "04:48:11", "text": "做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17294.43, "timestamp": "04:48:14", "text": "它。我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17300.31, "timestamp": "04:48:20", "text": "坏的。虽然有点慢，但应该没问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17302.55, "timestamp": "04:48:22", "text": "是的，还有另一个用户也遇到了这个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17304.47, "timestamp": "04:48:24", "text": "同名。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17308.07, "timestamp": "04:48:28", "text": "所以我不想把两者混淆，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17310.628, "timestamp": "04:48:30", "text": "你们俩同名，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17314.07, "timestamp": "04:48:34", "text": "沙。这就是我一直跟你保持联系的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17316.31, "timestamp": "04:48:36", "text": "就像我一直给你打电话一样。我希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17322.99, "timestamp": "04:48:42", "text": "是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17332.19, "timestamp": "04:48:52", "text": "所以我从来没见过他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17335.03, "timestamp": "04:48:55", "text": "尽管。骑师，我的拥抱呢？你想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17336.35, "timestamp": "04:48:56", "text": "一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17339.59, "timestamp": "04:48:59", "text": "抱抱？我该如何拥抱你呢？"}]